"Receipt presence; optional public Mac lookup by exact bundle ID and country. No account/receipt decoding or mas integration." = "检查商店收据是否存在；可按准确 bundle ID 和地区查询公开 Mac 商店记录。不解码账号或收据，不集成 mas。";
