"pipx/uv conventional tool environments and explicit project venvs, dist metadata, interpreter links and PEP 668 marker; static same-environment Requires-Dist and numeric constraints/markers; no execution, full PEP 440, extras or arbitrary sys.path reconstruction." = "读取 pipx/uv 常规工具环境、明确指定的项目 venv、软件包元数据、解释器链接和 PEP 668 标记；静态核对同环境的 Requires-Dist 与数值约束和标记。不运行环境，不完整解析 PEP 440、extras 或任意 sys.path。";
"PATH and conventional version-manager directories, symlink resolution and package metadata; version probes only for matching Homebrew core Node/Python/Bun/Go installations, no agent CLI startup." = "读取 PATH、常规版本管理器目录、符号链接和软件包元数据；仅对匹配 Homebrew core 的 Node/Python/Bun/Go 安装查询版本，不启动 Agent CLI。";
